# Disklordz agent fleet (company / repo-wide)

Before adding or changing Disklordz agents, workflows, or integrations:

1. Read **[DISKLORDZ_AGENTS.md](../../DISKLORDZ_AGENTS.md)** at repository root (orchestration: **workflow-automation**, **pm-agent**).
2. Read **[disklordz/agents/workflows/PM_ADD.md](../../disklordz/agents/workflows/PM_ADD.md)** for roster + automation paths.
3. Machine index: **[.github/agents/fleet.json](../../.github/agents/fleet.json)**.

Regenerate after spec changes: `./scripts/sync-disklordz-agent-fleet.sh`

New agents must appear in `_specs.json`, Copilot skills, PM ADD, and fleet entrypoints in the same change.
